000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID.    ACCTRPT.
000300 AUTHOR.       M OKONKWO.
000400 DATE-WRITTEN. 06/30/97.
000500*------------------------------------------------------------
000600* ACCTRPT - DAILY ACCOUNT ACTIVITY REPORT.
000700* HEADING AND TOTAL AREAS ARE COPIED ON THE SAME LINE AS THEIR 01.
000800*------------------------------------------------------------
000900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001000 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001100 FILE-CONTROL.
001200     SELECT RPT-FILE ASSIGN TO RPTOUT
001300         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
001400         FILE STATUS IS WS-RPT-STATUS.
001500 DATA DIVISION.
001600 FILE SECTION.
001700 FD  RPT-FILE
001800     RECORDING MODE IS F.
001900 01  RPT-LINE               PIC X(133).
002000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002100 01  WS-RPT-HEAD.  COPY RPTHDR.
002200 01  WS-RPT-TOTALS.  COPY RPTTOT. COPY RPTCNT.
002300 01  WS-RPT-STATUS          PIC X(2).
002400 01  WS-I                   PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
002500 01  WS-J                   PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
002600 01  WS-N                   PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 3.
002700 01  WS-HIST-TABLE.
002800     05  WS-HIST-AMT PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 OCCURS 12 TIMES.
002900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003000 0000-MAIN.
003100     OPEN OUTPUT RPT-FILE
003200     PERFORM 1000-HEADINGS
003300     PERFORM 2000-DETAIL WITH TEST AFTER UNTIL WS-I > 12
003400     PERFORM 2500-SCAN-HISTORY
003500     PERFORM 3000-TOTALS
003600     CLOSE RPT-FILE
003700     GOBACK.
003800 1000-HEADINGS.
003900     PERFORM TEST AFTER VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 2
004000        WRITE RPT-LINE FROM WS-RPT-HEAD
004100     END-PERFORM
004200     MOVE 0 TO WS-I.
004300 2000-DETAIL.
004400     PERFORM WS-N TIMES
004500        ADD 1 TO CNT-READ
004600     END-PERFORM
004700     PERFORM 3 TIMES
004800        ADD 1 TO CNT-WRITTEN
004900     END-PERFORM
005000     PERFORM TEST BEFORE UNTIL WS-J > 9
005100        ADD 1 TO WS-J
005200     END-PERFORM
005300     ADD 1 TO WS-I.
005400 2500-SCAN-HISTORY.
005500     PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-J > 12
005600        IF WS-HIST-AMT (WS-J) = ZERO
005700           EXIT PERFORM
005800        END-IF
005900        ADD WS-HIST-AMT (WS-J) TO TOT-DEBITS
006000     END-PERFORM
006100     PERFORM 2600-HISTORY-DONE.
006200 2600-HISTORY-DONE.
006300     MOVE 0 TO WS-J.
006400 3000-TOTALS.
006500     PERFORM 3100-FORMAT-TOTAL 2 TIMES
006600     WRITE RPT-LINE FROM WS-RPT-TOTALS.
006700 3100-FORMAT-TOTAL.
006800     ADD TOT-DEBITS TO TOT-CREDITS.
